// Propel — Authentication Flow
// Type: Sequence
// OIDC sequence: Browser → API Gateway → Keycloak → User Service

autoNumber on

Browser [icon: monitor, color: gray]
API Gateway [icon: shield, color: yellow]
Keycloak [icon: lock, color: red]
User Service [icon: users, color: green]

// Login flow
Browser > API Gateway: GET /api/auth/login
activate API Gateway
API Gateway > Browser: 302 Redirect to Keycloak
deactivate API Gateway
Browser > Keycloak: Authenticate (username/password)
activate Keycloak
Keycloak > Browser: Auth code (redirect back)
deactivate Keycloak
Browser > API Gateway: GET /api/auth/callback?code=...
activate API Gateway
API Gateway <> Keycloak: Exchange code for tokens
Keycloak > API Gateway: Access + ID + Refresh tokens
API Gateway > User Service: POST /api/users/sync (JWT)
activate User Service
User Service > API Gateway: X-User-Id header
deactivate User Service
API Gateway > Browser: Set cv_session cookie

loop [label: Session validation, color: yellow] {
  Browser > API Gateway: Request with cv_session
  API Gateway > API Gateway: Validate session, attach JWT
  API Gateway > Backend: Proxied request
  Backend > API Gateway: Response
  API Gateway > Browser: Response
}

// Registration flow
Browser > API Gateway: POST /api/auth/register
activate API Gateway
API Gateway > Keycloak: Create user via Admin API
Keycloak > API Gateway: User created
API Gateway > Kafka: emit user.registered
API Gateway > Browser: 201 Created
deactivate API Gateway